  "notes": [
    "The vulnerable implementation's transferFrom reads the staking module through getLockedAmount; until the owner's setNovoNFTAddress set that module pointer no NOVO transfer succeeded (no Transfer events between the upgrade and it), so that module change is the reset (rule 10).",
    "Victims are the NOVO/WBNB pair and the NOVO token contract, whose fee NOVO the 44 copycat transactions pulled with transferFrom(token, self, amount); their flows net within each transaction. NOVO is priced by DefiLlama after the crash."
